  "interpretation_limits": [
    "Registration order is BMP, JPG, TGA, ATC, PNG, DDS, PVR. The manager probes file contents in that order first, restoring the file position after each probe; only then does it try extension predicates in registration order. Most extension predicates use substring matching; PNG checks the final suffix.",
    "The manager routes ATC, DDS, and PVR through loadTextureHeader/createTexture/loadTextureData. Other image-loader routes use loadImage followed by the manager image-to-texture path.",
    "ITexture::map supplies views into texture CPU backing. If absent, map allocates backing and setData records its pointer and ownership. Unmap ends map state; the data remains associated with the texture for later upload. Outer cache/reference lifetime is not fully established.",
    "The texture update path tests the PFDTable compressed bit and selects glCompressedTexImage2D/glCompressedTexSubImage2D or glTexImage2D/glTexSubImage2D. This note does not implement pixel decoders or identify every asset's chosen format.",
    "ATC and DDS format integers are raw observed mappings. PVR/PVRTC and pixel conversion are covered by sibling notes."
